          Objective (designed by the tester): prove that the AT-x960-56YSQ acts as a RADIUS
          client. A RADIUS client is also called a Network Access Server (NAS).
          1. A real login on the DUT produces an Access-Request to the configured server.
          2. The DUT acts on the server's answer.
